  "title": "Springing into Action: GFL Volunteers Support Survivors with Shelter Movers",
  "summary": "Through our Full Circle Project (FCP), GFL is proud to partner with Shelter Movers, a Canadian volunteer-powered charity that provides free moving and storage services to individuals and families fleeing abuse. On May 28, our Vaughan office hosted a Spring-Cleaning Drive packing event. A team of ten volunteers gathered in the office lunchroom to assemble […]",
